# INCLUDE ready_boot — agent preamble + hard install prove checklist one-shot
# Usability: agent_boot (REQUIRE VERSION + VERSION) + NEEDREADY hard gate
#   INCLUDE ready_boot
#   # READY plate set · READY_OK == 1 or fail-fast (forms+libs+DOCTOR)
# Soft twin: READY alone (no fail). Hard twin: NEEDREADY / REQUIRE READY.
# Host dual: cubalc run -Y · CUBALC_REQUIRE_READY=1 · cubalc ready
#
# Scaffold: cubalc init demo --ready
# CLI dual: cubalc ready · cubalc needdoctor · run -Y
# HOLD_FLASH not required (runtime default 1 · same as agent_boot).

INCLUDE agent_boot
NEEDREADY
